      "repairSkill": "rule_of_70",
      "commonError": "Forgetting that doubling time is approximately 70 divided by the growth rate.",
      "q": "Country A has real GDP per person of $20,000 and grows at 2%. Country B has real GDP per person of $10,000 and grows at 6%. Using the Rule of 70, what is the strongest long-run implication?",
