      "q": "A market moves from $40 and 500 units before a tax to a buyer price of $46, seller receipt of $34, and 420 units afterward. On the units still sold after the tax, what is the sellers’ total loss from receiving a lower price? Exclude surplus lost on sales that no longer occur.",
