      "tag": "natural_unemployment",
      "type": "interpretation",
      "objective": "LO29.5",
      "feedback": "Both totals equal 5%, but the components differ. A common aggregate benchmark does not establish identical barriers or identical policy priorities. Relevant retraining and matching interventions target different components.",
