      "repairSkill": "binding_ceiling_shortage",
      "commonError": "cannot_connect_binding_status_to_shortage_size",
      "feedback": "Equilibrium is $30 and 200 units. The $20 maximum binds: Qs = 150 and Qd = 250, so the shortage is 100 and at most 150 units trade. The $40 maximum allows the equilibrium price below it; it does not force the market to charge $40.",
      "image": "question-assets/binding-price-ceilings/ceilingfloor.webp",
