      "q": "A benefit of $1,000 rises with a fixed-basket index that increases 8%. For these recipients, the minimum cost of maintaining last year’s utility rises 5% after substitution. How does the indexed benefit compare with that cost, and what follows if the adjustment instead uses 5%?",
