      "commonError": "Extrapolating an initial catch-up gain as a permanent growth rate.",
      "feedback": "Marginal contributions over the interval are 60/20=3 and 30/20=1.5. Scarce capital can yield larger gains, supporting catch-up. As capital accumulates with other determinants fixed, those gains diminish; the first interval cannot be extended unchanged forever.",
