      "commonError": "Incorrectly concludes “Natural unemployment is zero and cyclical unemployment 8 points; full employment requires everyone to have a job” in this natural rate of unemployment task.",
      "q": "Actual unemployment is 8%. An estimate puts frictional unemployment at 2% and structural unemployment at 3%. How much unemployment is natural versus cyclical, and how much would remain if weak demand were eliminated?",
