      "feedback": "Drainage plus the hospital upgrade fits: 11 crew-weeks and $8m, yielding $34m net. Bridge work plus the hospital upgrade would yield $35m but needs 13 weeks and $10m, exceeding both limits. Drainage plus bridge work fits but yields $29m; water repairs yield $24m. The rail choice forgoes the best feasible bundle, worth $34m; do not deduct project spending again.",
