      "feedback": "The original real factor 1.04/1.06 gives about a 1.9% loss. Current-period indexation addresses the lag. It does not guarantee that the chosen index matches each recipient's own price exposure.",
      "aHash": "512d2c80988ca498bacf414a53773c46b837e40934989fa8eecc6ab3ba8d18a0",
